    "faq_PkLr4c": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_item_MwwJeb": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if my dog doesn’t like the chews?",
            "content": "<p>In the rare case that this happens, we’ll issue you a full refund, no problem.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_XCiczB": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "At what age can my pup start using these?",
            "content": "<p>The Multivitamin is suitable for dogs of all ages and breeds. However, we do recommend dogs begin to incorporate the chews into their daily routine starting at an age of 3 months or older.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_cDDNeh": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does 100% Human-Grade mean?",
            "content": "<p>Most pet supplements from other brands contain palm oil, fillers, artificial flavoring, preservatives, etc. At VitalPaws, we’re raising the standards of pet health by only using the highest quality human-grade ingredients, which is what our best friends deserve.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_hjfFdp": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long until I start seeing the benefits?",
            "content": "<p>The benefits that most dogs feel—less itching, more activity, better mood—are just bonuses to improving their long-term health. If taken consistently on a daily basis, most dogs will start to see positive effects in about 6-8 weeks.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_r6nWYM": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How many chews come in a jar?",
            "content": "<p>There are <strong>60 Chews in each jar</strong>, which is a monthly supply for dogs of all weights (2 daly chews).</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_GNzUnr": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What flavour is the Multivitamin?",
            "content": "<p>Our Multivitamin is made with the highest quality human-grade duck meat, a flavor that dogs absolutely love.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_kWhNyN": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What happens if I accidentally give my dog too many chews?",
            "content": "<p>In the event that your dog accidentally consumes significantly more than the daily recommended dose, consult your vet for advice.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_3x6dBk": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I take this dog multivitamin with other supplements?",
            "content": "<p>Our veterinary team formulated our Daily Vitamin with natural ingredients that can be taken both alone or as a complementary product with other common and more targeted pet supplements. Nevertheless, we still recommend checking with your vet.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
